046597338830_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tGu2mevw3IcQ7kNvwH-StYj&_nc_oc=Adpx5AHZRAdCirTy3gVHJ6kUPH7M5UUxeolb366RKxtXKmtQXxtHkfD5WGw5dHsJGMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af17hL0p2j1F7fT7JwE5DjHcBhA4sBkEFi9J0TeQEpxwfw&oe=69F0A18C"}, {"file_name": "491821719_1924776444758679_6325647046597338830_n.png", "id": "1199301822259695", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304764_1199301825593028_6529866373013982083_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MFRe2lyduT0Q7kNvwFp3SU7&_nc_oc=AdohMVwzcuCj2Q-L8fUs1NOhZDjKNI8zJVVLrhgn0THkwd727YOUnb8p4CNcpxgAPCA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1LsKPhaXSN4XbPn0uGdtI_C5-Gsx5l7GnscQKt7wJ3vg&oe=69F0BC3B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Soninauts", "keywords": ["space", "astronomy", "galaxies", "stars", "sonification"], "long_description": "Embark on a cosmic VR adventure where sound rules. Dodge black holes, cross portals, and survive supernovas with the help \u2014or the taunts\u2014 of a sarcastic AI. In Soninauts, the universe speaks through sound, and only those who truly listen make it home.", "short_description": "Listen, dodge, survive. In Soninauts VR, the universe sounds, the AI taunts, your ears rule."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "747934274974523", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Soninautas", "keywords": ["espacio", "galaxias", "astronomia", "sonificacion"], "long_description": "Emb\u00e1rcate en una aventura c\u00f3smica VR donde el o\u00eddo manda. Esquiva agujeros negros, atraviesa portales y sobrevive a supernovas con la ayuda \u2014o las burlas\u2014 de una IA sarc\u00e1stica. En Soninautas, el universo suena, re\u00edrse del desastre es casi obligatorio, y solo quien escucha\u2026 vuelve a casa.", "short_description": "Escucha, esquiva, sobrevive. En Soninautas VR, el universo suena, la IA se burla y